"Maximum angle between the source model's normal and the feature's normal"
msgstr ""
"Maximaler Winkel zwischen der Normale des Quellmodells und der Feature-"
"Normale"

msgid ""
"Maximum amount of iterations performed until a stable set of points is found"
msgstr ""
"Maximale Anzahl der Iterationen, die ausgeführt werden, bis eine stabile "
"Punktmenge gefunden wird"

msgid "Refine"
msgstr "Verfeinern"

msgid "Find new source points near the feature and use them to refine it"
msgstr ""
"Neue Quellpunkte in der Nähe des Features finden und zur Verfeinerung "
"verwenden"

msgid "New Feature"
msgstr "Neues Feature"

msgid "Save created feature and start to define a new one"
msgstr "Erstelltes Feature speichern und ein neues definieren"

msgid "Developer features"
msgstr "Entwickler-Features"

